# Ghostty's GTK window on Dolly's X server, with Slop in it: the Xsdl server
# takes the display, and Ghostty draws its terminal with Mesa's OpenGL
# (softpipe through EGL, OpenGL 4.3 as Ghostty asks) and its window's
# widgets with cairo. GTK's text is fontconfig's, from the terminal's font.
INSTALL /v0.1.6/Dollyfile-core d69d0e16a3e1a7813171966d23fcf5a44d488a6bcf2723a3d32f689fa162fc5c
INSTALL /v0.1.6/Dollyfile-posix 9773acc9cc5cdbe7b4d9a355092dcf3bed9a77de6f1da50eb925d1d9690c68ba
INSTALL /v0.1.6/Dollyfile-display e1328f1decb7f81e8b508cf5f03c18246fdac37d39d259021ea69882d59f4d9f
INSTALL /v0.1.6/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 65b5d9a3a7b320897c23435635b2bc2bf29b27761fe1d5ab34057dc2e7c1f1cc
